msgctxt "gps_fallback_warning_title"
msgid "Using GPS only"
msgstr "Använder endast GPS"

#.  GpsFallbackWarningDialog: Body explaining network location is off and GPS
#. drains battery. Sentence
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "gps_fallback_warning_body"
msgid ""
"Network location isn't turned on for this device, so FindFamily is using GPS"
" only to keep tracking your location. GPS is more accurate but may cause "
"significant battery drain. To reduce battery use, turn on network (Wi-Fi & "
"mobile) location in your device settings."
msgstr ""
"Nätverksplats är inte aktiverad på enheten, så Find Family använder endast "
"GPS för att fortsätta spåra din plats. GPS är mer exakt men kan dra mycket "
"batteri. Aktivera nätverksplats (Wi-Fi och mobilnät) i enhetens "
"inställningar för att minska batterianvändningen."

#.  OutdatedPeerDialog: Title shown when connecting to someone whose app is
#. too old for post-quantum encryption. Noun phrase
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "outdated_peer_title"
msgid "Update needed"
msgstr "Uppdatering krävs"

#.  OutdatedPeerDialog: Body telling the user the other person must update
#. their app before sharing can work. Sentence
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "outdated_peer_body"
msgid ""
"This person is using an older version of FindFamily that doesn't support "
"quantum-safe encryption. Ask them to update their app, then try connecting "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Den här personen använder en äldre version av Find Family som inte stöder "
"kvantsäker kryptering. Be personen uppdatera appen och försök sedan ansluta "
"igen."

#.  KeyMismatchDialog: Title shown when a peer's encryption key doesn't match
