msgctxt "key_mismatch_title"
msgid "Couldn't verify this person"
msgstr "Kunde inte verifiera den här personen"

#.  KeyMismatchDialog: Body explaining the key check failed and the connection
#. was refused. Sentence
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "key_mismatch_body"
msgid ""
"The encryption key for this person doesn't match the one their invite link "
"listed, so they weren't added. Check that you opened the whole link, and ask"
" them to send a new one."
msgstr ""
"Krypteringsnyckeln för den här personen stämmer inte med den som personens "
"inbjudningslänk angav, så personen lades inte till. Kontrollera att du "
"öppnade hela länken och be personen skicka en ny."

